  "verseCount": 60,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu muneni hakwila nindi, Yumiyi yalala, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena nindi, Enu ana kwami, ninenu atata, tiyililenu. Nzambi walubanji lwakulema wamwekeni kudi nkakulula yetu Abarahama, hadiŋiyi muMesopotamiya, wuchidi kanda ashakami muHarana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumwila nindi, Fumaku mwituŋa denu, nikudi awusoku weyi, inzaŋa mwituŋa dinakakuleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakufuma mwituŋa dawaKaladeya, hakushakama muHarana. Kwenoku, chafwiliyi tata yindi, Nzambi hakumufumishaku nakumuleta mwituŋa dinu dimwashakama lelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamwinkeli mwoku wuswana, chalala hela hakudatila mwendu winduku. Wakanini kumwinka dindi nawanyanindi amba kalondelamu, hachidiŋiyi kanda avwali mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wahosheli mwakwila nindi, Anyaneyi akashakama mwituŋa dawenyi. Nindi akayiheta wuduŋu, nakuyikoŋa chatama nyaka makulakaji awana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi nindi, Owu muza wakayiheta nakawusompesha; nkumininaku amba kafumamu, amba kankalakela mwenamunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumwinka chitiyaŋenu chakwalama. Abarahama wavweli Isaka, hakumwalamisha ifuku damu chitanu nachisatu, Isaka wavweli Yakoba, Yakoba wavweli ankakulula ikumi nayedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu ankakulula amutiyili Yosefu ichima, hiyakumulandisha kudi antu, amutweli muEjipitu. Ilaŋa Nzambi wadiŋi nindi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakumupulwisha kumakabi indi ejima. Hemeniyi kumesu amwanta waEjipitu Fwaro, Nzambi hakumutiyisha Fwaro kuwaha nayena namaanindi; yena hakumubalumuna kwikala nguvulu yaEjipitu, nimukwakuhemba itala dindi dejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu mumpata yaEjipitu yejima nimuKenani, himukuholoka nzala; hiyakumona yihuŋu yayeni; ankakulula jetu hiyamweni yakudyaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba, chanatiyiyi nawu kuEjipitu kudi tidiku, hakutemeshaku ankakulula jetu ipampa dakusambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chayiluwu kamuchiyedi hakudimwekesha kudi ana kwindi; nimuza waYosefu awiluka nikudi Fwaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu hakutemesha nakutambika tata yindi Yakoba, niawusoku windi ejima, antu makumi atanu nayedi niatanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba hakukunkumukila muEjipitu. Hakufwa niyena niankakulula jetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyitwala kuShekemi nakuyikamika mwijamu ŋalandiliyi Abarahama nawuseya wasiliva kudi anyana kaHamori muShekemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili mwaka wamukaninuwu Abarahama kudi Nzambi hiwukuya nakushi ka, antu hiyakusweja kuvula nankashi muEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MuEjipitu muswana nimwanta wacheŋi wabulili kwiluka Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwantowu hakukwatila muza wetu maana, hakukoŋa ankakulula jetu chatama, hiyakunatisha anyikeki jawu, kulonda abuli kuhanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena mwakowu diwu wavwalikili Mosi, Nzambi hakumumona himwana wawutotombu; hiyakumulelela mwitala datata yindi tukweji tusatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanamunatuwu, mwana kaFwaro wamumbanda hakumunona, hakumulela neyi mwanindi wakudivwela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumuleja Mosi mwaya maana amuEjipitu ejima; hakusweja Ŋovu nikumazu indi nikunyidimu yindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili nyaka yindi yakukula yinakeŋi kushika munyaka makumi awana, mumuchima windi himukwinza jakuya nakuhempula ana kwindi aIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanamoniyi mwinawu wumu hiyakumukoŋa chatama, hakumwamwina, hakumutenda owu akabishiluwu, hakujaha owu kaEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watoŋojokeli nindi ana kwindi akwiluka chakuyamwinawu kudi Nzambi nachikasa chindi yena, aŋa wena kuchiluka nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikunachi, hakuyiwana adi nakulwisha mulwawu, yena hakukeŋa kuyihumaŋesha cheŋi nindi, Enu akwetu, ivumu denu dimu, muloŋanyi mudi nakudikoŋela chatama chochichi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu wamukoŋeli mukwawu chatama hakumushinjika Mosi nindi, Nakwinki mudimu wakutuyula hela kutusompesha, hinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keŋa wunjahi neyi chiwajaha ona kaEjipitu haloshi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi chanatiyiyi izu odu hakutemuka, hakushakama mwituŋa dakuMidiyani, hakuvwelaku anyana amayala ayedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinamani nyaka makumi awana, kaŋelu hakumwekana kudi yena mwisaŋa dakumpidi yaSinayi, mumuzuzu wakesi muchiputa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi chanachimoniyi, hakuhayama nakuchimona; hakwinza nakuswila kwakwihi, nindi atali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikukutiyakana izu daYehova nindi, Yami Nzambi yawankakulula jeyi, Nzambi yaAbarahama, niyaIsaka, niyaYakoba. Mosi hakuzaala woma, nikutwesha kutalaku nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumwila nindi, Subulaku nkwabilu jidi kunyendu yeyi, muloŋa hiwunemani hiiseki dajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalala namoni chadi nakukabishawu antu ami adi muEjipitu, natiyi chakwabawu; nasuluki dehi niyipulwishi. Dichi nakeŋi kukutemesha muEjipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu Mosi alekeluwu nawu, Nakwinki mudimu wakutuyula hela kutusompesha hinyi? diyi atemesheluwu kudi Nzambi ekali nyuli ninkúuli, nachikasa chayenowu kaŋelu wamwekeni kudi yena muchiputa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyi muntu wayifumishili muEjipitu chanakoŋiyi yihayamisha nayinjikijilu, nimuEjipitu, nimuKaluŋalwiji Kachinana, nimwisaŋa, nyaka makumi awana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeniwu diyi Mosi wayilili anyana kaIsarela nindi, Nzambi wakayimwekeshela kaprofwetu wahadi ana kwenu neyi ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyi wadiŋi muchipompelu omu mwisaŋa, hamu nanowu kaŋelu wahosheli nayena kumpidi yaSinayi, ninawankakulula jetu; diyi watambwili mazu amomi atuleji etu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu alekeluwu ankakulula jetu nawu etu kumwovwahila kwonti kwetu; hiyakumushinjika nawu tufumi; nyichima yawu hiyikufunta cheŋi kuEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumwila Aroni nawu, Wutwilili akishi kulonda atwaminini kutukuyetu; yeniwu Mosi, watufumishili mwituŋa daEjipitu, hituneluki kwanayiyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena mafuku owu hiyakwila mwana kaŋombi, hiyakuketwila yenowu mukishi chimuna, hiyakuzaŋalala nanyidimu yakumakasawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi hakubalumuka, hakuyileka kwindi, nindi apeshaŋa yileŋaleŋa yamwiwulu; neyi chasonekeluwu mumukanda wawatuprofwetu wajila nawu, Enu akwamutaŋa waIsarela, yami komana mwaketwililaŋa yimuna, mwaletelelaŋa nyilambu nyaka makumi awana muna mwisaŋa, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakwatili kutabanaka yaMoleki, nikukatumbwa kamukishi Refwana, diwu akishi mwalumbishili kulonda kudifukula kudi wena; ami nakayitwala kwakubadika Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ankakulula jetu adiŋi natabanaka yawunsahu omu mwisaŋa, yamukunjikiluwu Mosi kudi owu wahoshelaŋa nindi, hakumuleja nindi akatuŋi mwaya chifwikija chanamoniyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tabanaka yaleteluwu kudi ankakulula jetu nawa, hepililuwu hamu naYoshuwa nakutambula ituŋa dawaJentili atemwiniyi Nzambi kukuya ankakulula jetu, ndo nikumafuku aDavidi, amwenuwu kuwaha kudi Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu walombcli kunamutuŋila Nzambi yaYakoba hakushakama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Solomoni diyi wanamutuŋilili itala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, Mukwakubadika hashakamaŋa mwakutuŋa namakasa awantuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwomwaneliyi kaprofwetu nindi, Iwulu hiitanda dami dawanta, iseki hiitanda dakunyendu yami. Yehova nindi, Indi itala mukuntuŋilami kulonda nimoni mwakunookela, dishika hadihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yejimiyi hiyayituŋali kudami nachikasa chamuku?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwachinchika! Enu ayidima munyichima namatu! Yenu mwadikaŋaŋa naSpiritu Wajila mafuku ejima. Chelilaŋa ankakulula jenu, dichi chimwelaŋa ninenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaprofwetu wumwodihi anabuli kukabishawu kudi ankakulula jenu? Ajahili wena ayilejelaŋahu dehi chakenzayi Mukwakuloŋa; yenowu, yenu mwabalumukili kwikala akwakumufukeja, niambanji akumujaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwatambwili nshimbi jaloŋesheluwu mudi aŋelu, kujihemba nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena chanatiyuwu mazu owu, chiyitapa nimunyichima, hiyakumusumaŋena kumaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa yena, wenzala dehi Spiritu Wajila, hakutala mwiwulu swi-i, hakumona lubanji lwakulema kwaNzambi, niYesu nemani kuchikasa chaNzambi chachidiilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Talenu, namoni mumawulu munenzuluki, ni mwana kamuntu nemani kuchikasa chaNzambi chachidiilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa wena hiyakubidika naŋovu, hiyakusha nyinu mumatu awu, hiyakumulotokela namuchima wawu wumu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amutemuna nimuŋanda, amwasa nimalola. Ayinsahu hiyakutenteka mahinawu kunyendu yamukwenzi weyala, ijina dindi Sawulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumwasola Setefwanu malola, iku wudi nakutambika nindi, Mwanta Yesu, atambuli spiritu yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakufukama, hakubidika chakola nindi, Eyi Mwanta ayanakeni muloŋiwu. Chanahoshiyi mwenimu akama nitulu. Sawulu wadiŋi nakwiteja chanamujahuwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.60"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
